# This folder is setup to run multiple MESA models for a fixed M_ZAMS 
# and varying P_ZAMS. To use it on its own, create a period_grid file 
# like the one in the parent directory, and define the m variable (Msun)
# in ./gen_grid_file.

# After setting up the mass and periods, run ./gen_grid_file to generate 
# the input_grid file,
# and then ./mk_mesa_inputs to generate folders with the MESA setup for 
# each period. 
# This will also generate the run_grid file, which can be submitted to 
# slurm to run all models, and dispatch_grid, which will submit run_grid
# to slurm through disBatch.
# (see https://github.com/flatironinstitute/disBatch)

# If you have disBatch installed, simply call ./dispatch_grid
# Otherwise check the sbatch command in dispatch_grid 

# You may also use the period-specific folders as individual MESA 
# models, and run them with ./rn 

# To restore this folder to its original state, run ./clean. 
# Note that this will also delete period_grid.
